## Update Checklist

Before publishing any Avantis update:

1. **Fetch from DefiLlama API:**
   - [ ] `api.llama.fi/protocol/avantis` for TVL
   - [ ] `api.llama.fi/summary/fees/avantis` for fees/revenue
   - Extract: TVL by chain, 24h/7d/30d fees, all-time fees

2. **Fetch from CoinGecko API:**
   - [ ] `api.coingecko.com/api/v3/coins/avantis` for AVNT token
   - Extract: Price, market cap, FDV, volume, supply, ATH/ATL

3. **Update report metrics:**
   - [ ] TVL (currently $102.9M on Base)
   - [ ] Fee data (24h, 7d, 30d, all-time)
   - [ ] AVNT token price and market cap
   - [ ] Recalculate LP yield estimates

4. **Update footnotes:**
   - [ ] Note "retrieved via [API name] API" for all API data
   - [ ] Add 🔷 HARD DATA markers

5. **Citation check:**
   - [ ] Every footnote `[^N]:` has at least one `[^N]` reference in body
   - [ ] Run: `grep -o '\[\^[0-9]*\]' avantis.md | sort -u | wc -l`
   - [ ] Result should be 55+ (matching footnote count)

6. **Quality check:**
   - [ ] All numbers consistent across report
   - [ ] Unified vault model (not dual vault) correctly described
   - [ ] 100% fee to LPs noted (not 60/40 split)

